transparent hover:border-orange-200\">\n            <p class=\"text-xs font-bold text-stone-800 group-hover:text-orange-700 transition line-clamp-1\">🏨 【長野県】【2026年最新】軽井沢おすすめホテル・リゾート10選！</p>\n            <p class=\"text-[11px] text-stone-500 line-clamp-1\">北佐久郡軽井沢町（軽井沢駅前・旧軽井沢・中軽井沢・南軽井沢）</p>\n          </a>\n        \n      </div>\n    </div>\n  </div>\n\n  <div class=\"pt-3 text-center border-t border-amber-200/60 mt-4 flex flex-wrap items-center justify-center gap-3\">\n    <a href=\"/prefectures/features\" class=\"text-xs font-bold text-amber-700 hover:text-amber-900 underline\">\n      🎌 全47都道府県の厳選特集一覧を見る →\n    </a>\n  </div>\n</div>\n"
